				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body" aria-labelledby="firstHeading" data-mw-ve-target-container>
					<div class="vector-body-before-content">
							<div class="mw-indicators">
		</div>

						<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia</div>
						<div id="contentSub"><div id="mw-content-subtitle"></div></div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.25.0.0-alpha3" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><div class="shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux" style="display:none" about="#mwt1" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Short description","href":"./Template:Short_description"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Vegetarian tiffin restaurant in Gandhi Bazaar, Basavanagudi, South Bangalore"}},"i":0}}]}'>Vegetarian tiffin restaurant in Gandhi Bazaar, Basavanagudi, South Bangalore</div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt1"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata"/></span>
<p class="mw-empty-elt" id="mwAw"><span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt2" id="mwBA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use dmy dates","href":"./Template:Use_dmy_dates"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"June 2018"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_dmy_dates_from_June_2018" about="#mwt2" id="mwBQ"/>
<span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt3" id="mwBg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use Indian English","href":"./Template:Use_Indian_English"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"June 2018"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_Indian_English_from_June_2018" about="#mwt3"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_Wikipedia_articles_written_in_Indian_English" about="#mwt3" id="mwBw"/></p>

<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwCA"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:VidyarthiBhavanEntrance.jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwCQ"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:VidyarthiBhavanEntrance.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/VidyarthiBhavanEntrance.jpg/250px-VidyarthiBhavanEntrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/VidyarthiBhavanEntrance.jpg/500px-VidyarthiBhavanEntrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1600" data-file-height="1200" data-file-type="bitmap" height="188" width="250" class="mw-file-element" id="mwCg"/></a><figcaption id="mwCw">Vidyarthi Bhavan Entrance</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwDA"><b id="mwDQ">Vidyarthi Bhavan</b> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kannada_language" title="Kannada language" about="#mwt4" typeof="mw:Transclusion" class="mw-redirect" id="mwDg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"langx","href":"./Template:Langx"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"kn-Latn"},"2":{"wt":"Vidyārthi Bhavana"}},"i":0}}]}'>Kannada</a><span about="#mwt4">: </span><i lang="kn-Latn" about="#mwt4">Vidyārthi Bhavana</i><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Kannada-language_text" about="#mwt4" id="mwDw"/>; <abbr style="font-size:85%" title="literal translation" about="#mwt5" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:ExpandedAttrs" id="mwEQ" data-mw='{"attribs":[[{"txt":"title"},{"html":"&lt;span typeof=\"mw:Nowiki\" id=\"mwEA\">literal translation&lt;/span>"}]],"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lit","href":"./Template:Lit"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Student House"}},"i":0}}]}'>lit.</abbr><span style="white-space: nowrap;" about="#mwt5"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span class="gloss-quot" about="#mwt5">'</span><span class="gloss-text" about="#mwt5">Student House</span><span class="gloss-quot" about="#mwt5" id="mwEg">'</span>) is a vegetarian tiffin restaurant in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gandhi_Bazaar" title="Gandhi Bazaar" id="mwEw">Gandhi Bazaar</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basavanagudi" title="Basavanagudi" id="mwFA">Basavanagudi</a>, South <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangalore" title="Bangalore" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFQ">Bangalore</a>. It has been considered an iconic establishment of the area and Bangalore in general, with its masala dosa being particularly recognized.</p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwFg" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwFw" aria-labelledby="History"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="History">History</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Vidyarthi_Bhavan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: History"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwGA">It was founded in 1943 by Venketarama Ural to serve students who originally hailed from outside the city who were attending the nearby <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acharya_Pathasala_Public_School" title="Acharya Pathasala Public School" id="mwGQ">Acharya Pathasala Public School</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_College,_Bangalore" title="National College, Bangalore" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGg">National College</a> in addition to other schools in Gandhi Bazaar, an area known for having a high concentration of educational institutions. At that time, newly opened restaurants would be given names that featured the word "Bhavan" (<i id="mwGw">Bhavana</i>; <abbr style="font-size:85%" title="literal translation" about="#mwt7" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:ExpandedAttrs" id="mwHQ" data-mw='{"attribs":[[{"txt":"title"},{"html":"&lt;span typeof=\"mw:Nowiki\" id=\"mwHA\">literal translation&lt;/span>"}]],"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lit","href":"./Template:Lit"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"House"}},"i":0}}]}'>lit.</abbr><span style="white-space: nowrap;" about="#mwt7"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span class="gloss-quot" about="#mwt7">'</span><span class="gloss-text" about="#mwt7">House</span><span class="gloss-quot" about="#mwt7" id="mwHg">'</span>) at the end, which led to the establishment gaining its name.<sup about="#mwt11" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwHw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwIA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIQ">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIg">]</span></span></a></sup> Later, Parameshwara Udal took over before selling it to current owner Ramakrishna Adiga in 1970.<sup about="#mwt14" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwIw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJQ">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJg">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt17" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-News18_3-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"News18"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-News18-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-News18-3" id="mwJw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwKQ">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwKg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwKw">The Adigas trademarked the Vidyarthi Bhavan name in 2008, and ten years later sued two restaurants with similar names.<sup about="#mwt20" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwLA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwLQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLg">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwMA">Vidhyarthi Bhavan celebrated its 75th anniversary in 2018 with a silver jubilee celebration and by releasing a coffee table book, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/India_Post" title="India Post" id="mwMQ">India Post</a> released a special postal cover and stamp the same year.<sup about="#mwt23" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwMg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNA">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwNg" aria-labelledby="Food_and_reputation"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Food_and_reputation">Food and reputation</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Vidyarthi_Bhavan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Food and reputation"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwNw">The restaurant features a limited menu of South Indian breakfast items and is known for keeping its decor and food as close to its original state as possible.<sup about="#mwt24" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-News18_3-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"News18"}}'><a href="#cite_note-News18-3" id="mwOA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwOQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwOg">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwOw">]</span></span></a></sup> It is particularly noted for its crispy and buttery <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masala_dosa" title="Masala dosa" id="mwPA">masala dosa</a>, considered its signature dish.<sup about="#mwt27" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-6" id="mwPQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwPg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwPw">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt30" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-7"}}'><a href="#cite_note-7" id="mwQQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwQg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQw">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRA">]</span></span></a></sup> Arun Adiga, Ramakrishna's son, attributes its taste to using different proportions of red rice, methi and urad dal in the recipe compared to other places.<sup about="#mwt33" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-TH_8-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"TH"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-TH-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-TH-8" id="mwRQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRw">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSA">]</span></span></a></sup> The restaurant is also known for its clientele, with writers in particular patronizing the restaurant and using it as a "creative meeting space".<sup about="#mwt34" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-TH_8-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"TH"}}'><a href="#cite_note-TH-8" id="mwSQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwSg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSw">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTA">]</span></span></a></sup> At peak times, the restaurant is so popular that customers have to wait outside before their name is called to enter and often end up sharing tables.<sup about="#mwt37" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-9" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-9"}}'><a href="#cite_note-9" id="mwTQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwTg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTw">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt40" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-10"}}'><a href="#cite_note-10" id="mwUQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwUg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUw">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt41" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-TH_8-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"TH"}}'><a href="#cite_note-TH-8" id="mwVQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwVg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVw">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwWA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwWQ" aria-labelledby="See_also"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="See_also">See also</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Vidyarthi_Bhavan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: See also"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul id="mwWg"><li id="mwWw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangalore" title="Bangalore" class="mw-redirect" id="mwXA">Bangalore</a></li>
<li id="mwXQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuisine_of_Karnataka" title="Cuisine of Karnataka" class="mw-redirect" id="mwXg">Cuisine of Karnataka</a></li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwXw" aria-labelledby="Notes"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Notes">Notes</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Vidyarthi_Bhavan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Notes"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
