f="https://web.archive.org/web/20210426234429/https://www.newindianexpress.com/cities/bengaluru/2018/apr/01/gandhi-bazaars-vidyarthi-bhavan-celebrates-75-years-on-their-platter-1795480.html" class="external text" id="mwaw">Archived</a> from the original on 26 April 2021<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwbA">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwbQ">26 April</span> 2021</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+Indian+Express&amp;rft.atitle=Gandhi+Bazaar%27s+Vidyarthi+Bhavan+celebrates+75+years+on+their+platter&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newindianexpress.com%2Fcities%2Fbengaluru%2F2018%2Fapr%2F01%2Fgandhi-bazaars-vidyarthi-bhavan-celebrates-75-years-on-their-platter-1795480.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AVidyarthi+Bhavan" class="Z3988" about="#mwt9" id="mwbg"></span></span></li>
